      "text": [
        "392 - وَقَالَ اَلصَّادِقُ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ: «مَنْ غَسَّلَ مَيِّتاً فَسَتَرَ وَ كَتَمَ خَرَجَ مِنَ اَلذُّنُوبِ كَيَوْمَ وَلَدَتْهُ أُمُّهُ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.392 - Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) said:\n\"Whoever washes a deceased person and conceals and keeps secret what they see, they will emerge from their sins like the day their mother gave birth to them.\""
        ]
      }
